<article class="legal">
  <div class="eyebrow mb-2">Last updated <%= updated %></div>
  <h1 class="mb-3">Terms of use</h1>

  <div class="legal__note">
    DeniseClothing is a demo store built as a student portfolio project. You're welcome to try it out,
    but it isn't a real shop.
  </div>

  <h2>1. This is a demo</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>No real products are for sale and nothing will be shipped.</li>
    <li>Payments run in Stripe's test mode. No real money is taken. Use Stripe's test card
      <code>4242 4242 4242 4242</code> with any future date and any 3-digit CVC.</li>
    <li>Please don't enter real card details. Test mode won't accept them anyway.</li>
    <li>Products, prices and stock levels are made up and may change at any time.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>2. Your account</h2>
