    <li>Use your own email address and keep your password to yourself.</li>
    <li>You're responsible for what happens under your account.</li>
    <li>You can delete your account at any time from <a href="/account/settings">Account settings</a>.</li>
    <li>We may remove accounts that break these terms.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>3. Using the site fairly</h2>
  <p>Please don't:</p>
  <ul>
    <li>try to get into other people's accounts or data</li>
    <li>try to break, overload or get around the site's security</li>
    <li>use automated tools to scrape the site or create accounts</li>
    <li>upload anything illegal, offensive or that you don't have the right to share</li>
  </ul>
  <p>
    If you find a security problem, please tell us instead of using it.
    To get in touch, <%- include('partials/contact') %>.
  </p>

  <h2>4. Reviews and photos</h2>
  <p>
    Reviews you post are shown publicly with your name, and your profile photo is shown in your account.
    You keep ownership of what you post, and you allow us to show it on this site.
    We may remove reviews or photos that break these terms.
