    The site is provided "as is", without any promise that it will be accurate, available or free of errors.
    As far as the law allows, we aren't responsible for any loss that comes from using it.
  </p>

  <h2>7. Your privacy</h2>
  <p>How we handle your data is explained in the <a href="/privacy">privacy policy</a>.</p>

  <h2>8. Changes and law</h2>
  <p>
    We may update these terms. The date at the top shows when they last changed.
    These terms are governed by the laws of Singapore.
  </p>

  <h2>9. Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about these terms? <%- include('partials/contact') %>.</p>
